        "factConfirmed": "∛√(a²b⁵) × √∛(a⁴b⁷); choice ③ is 3."
      },
      "afterContent": "$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{a^2 b^5}} \\times \\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{a^4 b^7}} = a^x b^y$일 때, $x+y$의 값은? (단, $a>0, b>0$) [3.7점]",
      "answerDerivation": "Each nested radical contributes exponent 1/6; total a exponent=1 and b exponent=2, so x+y=3.",
